{#- Cosimo chat template.

     Structure, markers and eos behaviour follow the Phi-4 vendor template minus
     its hardcoded vendor identity preamble, which contradicts the identity being
     trained. (The preamble is quoted verbatim in cosimo_ft/chat.py and in
     tests/conftest.py, which assert it survives nowhere; it is deliberately not
     repeated in this file, because those assertions read this file's text.)

     TOOL CALLING (for the LangGraph -> ChatOpenAI -> vLLM serving path):

     * `tools` arrives as a TOP-LEVEL variable. That is what
       transformers' apply_chat_template(..., tools=[...]) populates, and
       therefore what vLLM's OpenAI server passes through from the request's
       `tools` parameter. The vendor template read `message['tools']` instead --
       a per-message key nothing ever sets -- so tool schemas were silently
       dropped and the model answered as though no tools existed. That key is
       still honoured as a fallback, but nothing in the harness sets it.

     * Assistant tool calls render as <tool_call>{"name":..,"arguments":{..}}</tool_call>,
       which is what vLLM's `--tool-call-parser hermes` reads back off the
       generated text. The markers are ordinary text, not special tokens: adding
       special tokens would require an embedding resize, and LoRA targets only
       the projections (configs/sft.yaml), so new embedding rows would never
       train.

     * Tool results render as a <|user|> turn wrapping <tool_response>. Using the
       user marker is deliberate: unsloth's train_on_responses_only splits on
       chat.instruction_part / chat.response_part, so in a multi-turn tool
       conversation every assistant turn stays supervised and every tool result
       stays masked, with no change to the masking configuration.

     A [system, user] conversation with no tools renders byte-identically to the
     pre-tool-calling version of this template, so already-prepared data and the
     FakeTokenizer in tests/conftest.py are unaffected.
-#}
{%- set ns = namespace(system_seen=false) -%}
{%- for message in messages -%}
{%- if message['role'] == 'system' -%}
{{- '<|system|>' -}}
{%- if 'content' in message and message['content'] -%}
{{- message['content'] -}}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if tools and not ns.system_seen -%}
{{- '<|tool|>' + (tools | tojson) + '<|/tool|>' -}}
{%- elif 'tools' in message and message['tools'] -%}
{{- '<|tool|>' + message['tools'] + '<|/tool|>' -}}
{%- endif -%}
{%- set ns.system_seen = true -%}
{{- '<|end|>' -}}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{#- Tools bound without any system message would otherwise be dropped, which is
    the exact failure this template was changed to fix. -#}
{%- if tools and not ns.system_seen -%}
{{- '<|system|><|tool|>' + (tools | tojson) + '<|/tool|><|end|>' -}}
{%- endif -%}
{%- for message in messages -%}
{%- if message['role'] == 'tool' -%}
{{- '<|user|><tool_response>' -}}
{%- if 'name' in message and message['name'] -%}
{{- {'name': message['name'], 'content': message['content']} | tojson -}}
{%- else -%}
{{- {'content': message['content']} | tojson -}}
{%- endif -%}
{{- '</tool_response><|end|>' -}}
{%- elif message['role'] != 'system' -%}
{{- '<|' + message['role'] + '|>' -}}
{%- if 'content' in message and message['content'] -%}
{{- message['content'] -}}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if 'tool_calls' in message and message['tool_calls'] -%}
{%- for call in message['tool_calls'] -%}
{#- OpenAI wire shape is {"function": {"name", "arguments"}}; transformers and
    LangChain both also emit the flattened {"name", "args"} shape locally. -#}
{%- set fn = call['function'] if 'function' in call else call -%}
{%- set fn_args = fn['arguments'] if 'arguments' in fn else fn['args'] -%}
{{- '<tool_call>{"name": ' + (fn['name'] | tojson) + ', "arguments": ' -}}
{#- `arguments` is a JSON *string* on the OpenAI wire and a mapping locally. -#}
{%- if fn_args is string -%}
{{- fn_args -}}
{%- else -%}
{{- fn_args | tojson -}}
{%- endif -%}
{{- '}</tool_call>' -}}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- endif -%}
{{- '<|end|>' -}}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- if add_generation_prompt -%}
{{- '<|assistant|>' -}}
{%- else -%}
{{- eos_token -}}
{%- endif -%}
